2:6; Col 1:16; Heb 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-18","title":"John 5:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>the Jews. 7:19 broken. 7:22,23; Mt 12:5 God was. 23; 8:54,58; 10:30,33; 14:9,23; Zec 13:7; Php 2:6; Re 21:22,23 Re 22:1,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-19","title":"John 5:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Verily. 24,25; 3:3 The Son. 30; 8:28; 9:4; 12:49; 14:10,20 for. 14:16-23; Ge 1:1,26; Isa 44:24; Col 1:16 Compare. 22 with. Ps 50:6; 2Co 5:10; Joh 2:19; 10:18 with. Ac 2:24; Ro 6:4; 1Co 15:12; 1Pe 3:18 and. 21,25,26 with. Eph 1:18,19; 2:5 and. 28,29; 11:25,26 with. Ro 8:11; 2Co 4:14; Php 3:21; 1Th 4:14; Ps 27:14; 138:3; Isa 45:24 with. 2Co 12:9,10; Eph 3:16; Php 4:13; Col 1:11; Ex 4:11; Pr 2:6 with. Lu 21:15; Jer 17:10 with. Re 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-20","title":"John 5:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>the Father. 3:35; 17:26; Mt 3:17; 17:5; 2Pe 1:17 and sheweth. 1:18; 10:32; 15:15; Pr 8:22-31; Mt 11:27; Lu 10:22 greater. 21,25,29; 12:45-47</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-21","title":"John 5:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>as. De 32:39; 1Ki 17:21; 2Ki 4:32-35; 5:7; Ac 26:8; Ro 4:17-19 even. 11:25,43,44; 17:2; Lu 7:14,15; 8:54,55</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-22","title":"John 5:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>27; 3:35; 17:2; Ps 9:7,8; 50:3-6; 96:13; 98:9; Ec 11:9; 12:14; Mt 11:27 Mt 16:27; 25:31-46; 28:18; Ac 10:42; 17:31; Ro 2:16; 14:10-12 2Co 5:10; 2Th 1:7-10; 2Ti 4:1; 1Pe 4:5; Re 20:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-23","title":"John 5:23","author":"R. A. Torrey