ah.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-28","title":"John 5:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Marvel. 20; 3:7; Ac 3:12 for. 6:39,40; 11:25; Job 19:25,26; Isa 26:19; Eze 37:1-10; Ho 13:14 1Co 15:22,42-54; Php 3:21; 1Th 4:14-17; Re 20:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-29","title":"John 5:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>come. Da 12:2,3; Mt 25:31-46; Ac 24:15 done good. Lu 14:14; Ro 2:6-10; Ga 6:8-10; 1Ti 6:18; Heb 13:16; 1Pe 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-30","title":"John 5:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>can. 19; 8:28,42; 14:10 I judge. 8:15,16; Ge 18:25; Ps 96:13; Isa 11:3,4; Ro 2:2,5 because. 4:34; 6:38; 8:50; 17:4; 18:11; Ps 40:7,8; Mt 26:39; Ro 15:3 Ho 10:7-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-31","title":"John 5:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>8:13,14,54; Pr 27:2; Re 3:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-32","title":"John 5:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>is another. 36,37; 1:33; 8:17,18; 12:28-30; Mt 3:17; 17:5; Mr 1:11; Lu 3:22 1Jo 5:6-9 and I. 12:50</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-33","title":"John 5:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>sent. 1:19-27 he. 1:6-8,15-18,29-34; 3:26-36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-34","title":"John 5:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>I receive. 41; 8:54 that. 20:31; Lu 13:34; 19:10,41,42; 24:47; Ro 3:3; 10:1,21; 12:21; 1Co 9:22 1Ti 2:3,4; 4:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-35","title":"John 5:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>was. 1:7,8; Mt 11:11; Lu 1:15-17,76,77; 7:28; 2Pe 1:19 and ye. 6:66; Eze 33:31; Mt 3:5-7; 11:7-9; 13:20,21; 21:26; Mr 6:20 Ga 4:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-36","title":"John 5:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>I have. 32; 1Jo 5:9,11,12 the works. 3:2; 9:30-33; 10:25,37,38; 11:37; 14:10,11; 15:24; 17:4; Ac 2:22 Mt 11:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-37","title":"John 5:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>borne. 6:27; 8:18; Mt 3:17; 17:5 See on 32 Ye have. 1:18; 14:9; 15:24; Ex 20:19; De 4:12; 1Ti 1:17; 6:16; 1Jo 1:1,2 1Jo 4:12,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-38","title":"John 5:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>ye have. 42,46,47; 8:37,46,47; 15:7; De 6:6-9; Jos 1:8; Ps 119:11; Pr 2:1,2 Pr 7:1,2; Col 3:16; Jas 1:21,22; 1Jo 2:14 for. 43; 1:11; 3:18-21; 12:44-48; Isa 49:7; 53:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-39","title":"John 5:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>Search. 46; 7:52; De 11:18-20; 17:18,19; Jos 1:8; Ps 1:2; 119:11,97-99 Pr 6:23; 8:33,34; Isa 8:20; 34:16; Jer 8:9; Mt 22:29; Mr 12:10 Lu 16:29,31; Ac 8:32-35; 17:11; Ro 3:2; Col 3:16; 2Ti 3:14-17 2Pe 1:19-21 ye think. De 32:47; Ps 16:11; 21:4; 36:9; 133:3; Da 12:2; Mt 19:16-20 Lu 10:25-29; Heb 11:16,35 they which. 32,36; 1:45; De 18:15,18; Ac 26:22,23,27; Ro 1:2; 1Pe 1:10,11 Re 19:10 See on Lu 24:27,44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-5-40","title":"John 5:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd"